    {
      "text": "Dashboard page for Lupara District Hospital, 2019, with a reporting completeness table for eight report types (F. 0.3; 7–8 reports submitted each month, inpatient report missing in March and outpatient report in September) and section “3. Service utilization”: line charts of new and repeat outpatient visits (F. 3.1) and inpatient discharges (F. 3.2), 100% stacked bar charts of outpatient visits (F. 3.3) and inpatient discharges (F. 3.4) by age group (0–4 years about 21–45%), and a bar chart of emergency unit visits by age group (F. 3.5), which rise towards December.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
